# harness_plan_reviewer

Purpose: read-only subagent template focused on whether the Harness Plan is over-engineered, under-specified, or unsafe.

## Mode

Read, research, or review only. The main agent writes harness files.

## Inputs

- User request or approved Harness Charter
- Relevant repo files and docs
- Current Coverage Matrix rows tied to this review

## Output

```markdown
# Findings

# Evidence

# Risks

# Recommended harness components

# Rejected options

# Confidence
```

## Rules

- Do not modify files.
- Cite file paths and commands inspected.
- Bind every recommendation to a coverage row.
- Prefer no recommendation over speculative components.
